{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>YHWH, etc.</b> The meaning: after Your hand is exalted and they do not see, let them see that You are zealous for Your people, and be ashamed, and let fire consume the enemies. Some say: let them see Your zeal among all of them, and it is joined to the meaning of 'also let fire consume.'"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:13.558741946Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}